<BehaviorPatch #track.r_2_0_2_6_-_0_6_-_0_8_-_0_8_0_0_-_d_e_s_i_g_n_-_r_u_n_t_i_m_e_-_c_o_n_t_r_o_l_-_e_n_g_i_n_e.behavior_patch.ai-runtime-control-engine-adoption apiVersion="codument.tech/v1alpha1" version="1" { capability = "ai-runtime-control-engine-adoption" } (
  <Mutations [
    <Upsert { selector = "behavior://ai-runtime-control-engine-adoption/requirements/domain-wrapper" } (
      <Requirement #domain-wrapper (
        <Statement ?01M05F1PGGSV6G484Y1DKKZ140>
        AI runtime SHALL 通过 AI 领域 wrapper 采用 runtime control engine，将 mailbox、conversation、snapshot、tool/effect result、ingress 和 diagnostics 映射为 vendor 层 command、effect 和 durable head，并通过 depa-actor@0.2.0 CommandDequeGroup 表达内部 command worklist。
        </?01M05F1PGGSV6G484Y1DKKZ140>
        <Suites [
          <Suite #domain-mapping { name = "领域映射" } (
            <Cases [
              <Case #vendor-hidden-from-ai-runtime-callers (
                <Given ?01M05F1PGGSV6G484Y1DKKZ141>
                AI runtime 需要提交 human input、tool result 或 snapshot 相关操作
                </?01M05F1PGGSV6G484Y1DKKZ141>
                <When ?01M05F1PGGSV6G484Y1DKKZ142>
                业务代码调用 runtime-control 能力
                </?01M05F1PGGSV6G484Y1DKKZ142>
                <Then ?01M05F1PGGSV6G484Y1DKKZ143>
                业务代码 SHALL 调用 AI 领域语义化 primitive，而不是直接拼装 vendor durable cohort 细节
                </?01M05F1PGGSV6G484Y1DKKZ143>
              )>
            ]>
          )>
        ]>
      )>
    )>
    <Upsert { selector = "behavior://ai-runtime-control-engine-adoption/requirements/adopt-after-engine-validation" } (
      <Requirement #adopt-after-engine-validation (
        <Statement ?01M05F1PGGSV6G484Y1DKKZ144>
        AI runtime SHALL NOT 用未独立验证的 runtime control engine 替换现有编排路径；替换前必须通过 vendor engine conformance tests 和 AI session recovery adoption tests。
        </?01M05F1PGGSV6G484Y1DKKZ144>
        <Suites [
          <Suite #replacement-gate { name = "替换门禁" } (
            <Cases [
              <Case #test-before-runtime-replacement (
                <Given ?01M05F1PGGSV6G484Y1DKKZ145>
                runtime control engine 设计或实现已完成
                </?01M05F1PGGSV6G484Y1DKKZ145>
                <When ?01M05F1PGGSV6G484Y1DKKZ146>
                准备替换 AI runtime 的 session 编排和持久化路径
                </?01M05F1PGGSV6G484Y1DKKZ146>
                <Then ?01M05F1PGGSV6G484Y1DKKZ147>
                系统 SHALL 先通过 crash recovery、dirty head classification、long-running effect wait 和 cohort commit 测试
                </?01M05F1PGGSV6G484Y1DKKZ147>
              )>
            ]>
          )>
        ]>
      )>
    )>
  ]>
)>
